AB  - Human emotions are complex and multimodal. Multimodal recognition of human emotions has a profound impact on interpersonal communication, mental health, and the development of intelligent technology. At present, the integration of artificial intelligence and deep learning for multimodal human emotion recognition plays an important role, especially the 3D-CNN learning model. Based on the current problem of lack of data, this paper proposes a deep learning model based on 3D-CNN to enhance robustness and accuracy through transfer learning and data augmentation stage fusion. The multimodal recognition of human emotions in the database was mainly carried out through three methods: EEG signal recognition, face recognition and fusion recognition. It turned out to be. The recognition accuracy of the wake-up class proposed in this paper is as high as 96.79%, and it has excellent recognition effect.
