AB  - In today’s world, soft skills are as important as technical skills, and students need to master them to succeed in the job market and in their personal lives. However, many students struggle with expressing themselves and communicating effectively in group settings, even if they possess a lot of knowledge. Inadequate communication skills may lead to missed opportunities and negatively impact one’s success. To address this problem, we are developing a cross-platform application that will assist students in improving their soft skills and build confidence to speak up which has not been covered by an application till now. The goal of this application is to help students overcome their fear of speaking and enhance their communication skills in a variety of settings. Social anxiety is often considered a lifelong condition that cannot be cured, but we believe that there are ways to help students build their confidence and overcome their anxiety. We are exploring state-of-the-art models that extract emotions and body postures to help students gain confidence. By analyzing sound and video inputs, we can measure the student’s confidence level and assign them various activities to help boost it. Our application will provide a personalized learning experience that will enable students to identify their areas of improvement and focus on enhancing their skills in those areas. We hope that this application will be a valuable tool for students looking to improve their soft skills and build confidence in themselves, and that it will empower them to succeed both in their personal and professional lives.
