weld defects classification; fast fingerprint classification VIA frequency patterns; 3D cooperative localization for surveillance applications; image retrieval over noisy wireless networks; overview of three-dimensional GIS data models; shape matching using the minimum area rectangle; prediction of clinical depression in adolescents using facial image analysis; detection and recognition of moving objects using temporal difference method and hidden Markov model; subjective quality evaluation of joint coding in H264 video coding standard; a 3D based framework for production audit in industrial applications and interpolation method identification from resampled images.
